    "block_weight_formula": "w_j=B_block*m_j / sum_(k in same block)m_k; empty blocks zero. Current B=[0,1,2,1] and binary m give selected shape1/2, pair2/5, landmark1/17.",
    "node_contrast": "a_tj=mean_b[(hi_scaled_b,t,j-lo_scaled_b,t,j)/V_b,t,j]; R_t(Y)=sum_j w_j*z_j*clip(a_tj,-3,3).",
    "legendre_effect": "c_j(t)=sum_k beta_jk P_k(2*(t-a)/(b-a)-1); a_tj=c_j(t)/mean_b V_b,t,j. V is same-node batch candidate variance divided by s_j^2 plus .05 ridge. Denominator is not averaged over time.",
    "mode_difference": "Legendre c拟合批次平均的high-low标准化差异。除以mean variance不同于mean(contrast/variance)；模式切换同时改变时间拟合和方差聚合，不能描述成仅做平滑。",
    "gradient": "计划接入 g_t=J_Y(x_t)^T grad_Y R_t(Y)，cond及非坐标输入固定。无时导数或head loss，pre-native VJP在native update后滞后注入。",
    "units": "z、V、a、w及reward无量纲；shape尺度A^2，softmin尺度A，核尺度无量纲。空间梯度含1/A，真实VJP还含模型coord_scale。",
    "normalization_limit": "保持块内系数预算不等于保持实际梯度大小；不同observable梯度和FLOWR Jacobian会改变取消、cap与实际dose。",
